<!--
    comp_mixed.rou.xml
    ==================
    COMPOSITION: Mixed Fleet (intermediate between baseline and heavy)
      car_standard:    55%  (between 40% baseline and 20% heavy)
      truck_light:     18%  (up from 15%)   — HBEFA3/HDV
      bus_city:        12%  (between 15% and 20%)
      delivery_van:     7%  (between 10% and 15%)
      vehicle_general:  5%  (down from 10%)
      coach_long:       3%  (down from 10%, moderate heavy presence)

    Same total demand structure as baseline (568 veh/hr, 142/approach).
    run_composition_experiment.py scales vehsPerHour by (target_vol / 568).

    Per approach turn split: S=37%, L=32%, R=31%.
    Per approach straight (52.5): car=28.9, trk=9.5, bus=6.3, van=3.7, gen=2.6, coa=1.6
    Per approach left (45.4):     car=24.9, trk=8.2, bus=5.4, van=3.2, gen=2.3, coa=1.4
    Per approach right (44.0):    car=24.2, trk=7.9, bus=5.3, van=3.1, gen=2.2, coa=1.3
-->
